|passage=And Martin Skrtel's late headed goal was rightly ruled out for offside.}}

====Synonyms====
* (''reject''): [[eliminate]], [[reject]]

* (''make impossible''): [[preclude]]

====Antonyms====
* (''reject''): [[consider]], [[rule in]]
* (''make impossible''): [[allow]]

